abstract: >-
  Training code for the TL;DR summarisation model of the Lit2Vec workflow:
  DistilBART (sshleifer/distilbart-cnn-12-6) fine-tuned on 19,992 CC-BY
  chemistry abstracts with GPT-4o-generated summaries, together with the
  evaluation notebooks used for the benchmark in the paper.
